s of the Coast, 8 Jan 2026."}},{"id":"lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed-e7","era":null,"summary":"Cerys finds a hidden stem of dawnglove and an unsent letter that shows Gethin almost gave it to Rhain.","participants":["cerys-awbrey","gethin","rhain-breckon","dawnglove"],"location":"shadowmoor","importance":"major","page":"stories/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed","order":989,"story_date":"2026-01-08","storyline":"Lorwyn Eclipsed","source":"wizards","paragraph":101,"quote":"This is what Rhain had asked Uncle Gethin for , she realized","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed#:~:text=This%20is%20what%20Rhain,for%20%2C%20she%20realized","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Star-Crossed","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Akemi Dawn Bowman"],"date":"2026-01-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed#:~:text=This%20is%20what%20Rhain,for%20%2C%20she%20realized","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Star-Crossed\" by Akemi Dawn Bowman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Jan 2026."}},{"id":"lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed-e8","era":null,"summary":"Cerys asks Rhain if he is dying and he answers that he is.","participants":["cerys-awbrey","rhain-breckon"],"location":"shadowmoor","importance":"major","page":"stories/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed","order":989,"story_date":"2026-01-08","storyline":"Lorwyn Eclipsed","source":"wizards","paragraph":109,"quote":"Not an hour passed before a reply settled on the desk in front of her.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed#:~:text=Not%20an%20hour%20passed,in%20front%20of%20her.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Star-Crossed","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Akemi Dawn Bowman"],"date":"2026-01-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed#:~:text=Not%20an%20hour%20passed,in%20front%20of%20her.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Star-Crossed\" by Akemi Dawn Bowman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Jan 2026."}},{"id":"lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed-e9","era":null,"summary":"Rhain writes his final letter confessing his feelings for Cerys and collapses.","participants":["rhain-breckon","cerys-awbrey"],"location":"lorwyn","importance":"major","page":"stories/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed","order":989,"story_date":"2026-01-08","storyline":"Lorwyn Eclipsed","source":"wizards","paragraph":122,"quote":"You, Cerys, are the very best part of my day.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed#:~:text=You%2C%20Cerys%2C%20are%20the,part%20of%20my%20day.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Star-Crossed","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Akemi Dawn Bowman"],"date":"2026-01-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed#:~:text=You%2C%20Cerys%2C%20are%20the,part%20of%20my%20day.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Star-Crossed\" by Akemi Dawn Bowman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Jan 2026."}},{"id":"lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed-e10","era":null,"summary":"Cerys crosses the aurora and feeds Rhain dawnglove, reviving him.","participants":["cerys-awbrey","rhain-breckon","dawnglove"],"location":"lorwyn","importance":"major","page":"stories/lorwyn-eclipsed-star-crossed","order":989,"story_date":"2026-01-08","storyline":"Lorwyn Eclipsed","source":"wizards","paragraph":136,"quote":"You fed me dawnglove. You crossed the aurora.","link":"https://ma